before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>

int *counter(void) {
 static int n = 0;
 ++n;
 return &n;
}
int main(void) {
 int *first = counter();
 counter();
 printf("%d\n", *first);
}
```

